### 4: a decision model (Jev) picks which model answers
@host = http://localhost:8099

# Needs TYPESAFE_API_KEY. /route is one Jev call and no LLM call. /chat adds one OpenAI call.

### R1. A card FAQ, decision only: LUNA (gpt-6-luna)
POST {{host}}/api/router/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How do I freeze my debit card?"
}

### R2. A duplicate charge: SOL (gpt-6.1-sol)
POST {{host}}/api/router/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I was charged twice at Acme Coffee on October 5. Can you check?"
}

### R3. Hardship: ASTRA (gpt-6-astra)
POST {{host}}/api/router/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I lost my job and can't make my mortgage payment this month. What can I do?"
}

### R4. Route, then answer with the chosen model
POST {{host}}/api/router/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How do I freeze my debit card?"
}

### R5. An unclear question: if Jev isn't sure, the gate picks a stronger tier and "reason" says so
POST {{host}}/api/router/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Can I skip a payment this month?"
}
